# Generated by the Nimbus build.
apps/docs/.nimbus/

# Generated artifacts, owned by their generators rather than by Prettier.
#
# ⚠ apps/api/openapi.json IS CHECKED FOR DRIFT IN CI. The generator writes it
# with JSON.stringify(…, 2); Prettier collapses short arrays onto one line. With
# both formatting it, `bun run format` and `bun run --filter @i10/api openapi`
# produce different bytes and the drift job can never pass.
apps/api/openapi.json
apps/docs/public/scalar/

# ⚠ WRITTEN BY `drizzle-kit generate`, AND THE SAME TRAP AS openapi.json ABOVE.
# Prettier and drizzle-kit format JSON differently, so with both owning these
# files `bun run format` and `bun run db:generate` produce different bytes — and
# whichever ran last makes the other look like a pending change. 0034 landed
# unformatted and would have failed `format:check` on the next push; ignoring the
# directory is the fix, not reformatting files their generator will rewrite.
apps/api/drizzle/meta/

# Local Terraform working directories. Untracked, so CI never sees them — this
# only stops `format:check` failing on a developer's machine after a `tofu init`.
**/.terraform/

# Vendored agent skills, installed by `bunx skills add`. Third-party files
# whose formatting belongs to their publisher — reformatting them would produce
# a diff against every upstream update for no benefit, and `.claude/skills`
# only symlinks into here.
.agents/
